*SPEF "IEEE 1481-1998"
*DESIGN "mc"
*DATE "now"
*VENDOR "test"
*PROGRAM "klayout-rs"
*VERSION "0.1"
*DESIGN_FLOW ""
*DIVIDER /
*DELIMITER :
*BUS_DELIMITER [ ]
